# Two more states of the liveness window that no other section photographs:
# 1. A very dark room (pack q-s3-dark: S3 at 20% brightness, made in software): "Improve lighting." while the
#    check runs; a low-light ending does not use an attempt (up to passive.low_light_max_uncounted).
# 2. A face device that refuses the stream (MockMDS fault UNAVAILABLE, STREAM answers 608): the device message
#    "The face camera is not available..." with Retry; device errors never use an attempt.
label screens 3: dark room, device unavailable
set RESIDENT_NAME Jaya Resident
set LEFT_EXCEPTION sleep 1
include lib/registration-start.flow
source q-s3-dark
click #individualBiometricsScanBtn
expect Improve lighting 60
snap state-too-dark
click #cancelButton
sleep 2000
source s3-main
mds /admin/fault {"type":"Face","fault":"UNAVAILABLE"}
click #individualBiometricsScanBtn
expect not available 60
snap state-device-unavailable
mds /admin/fault {"type":"Face","fault":"NONE"}
click #cancelButton
sleep 2000
click #homeImgView
sleep 1500
if-node #confirm click #confirm
sleep 2000
